[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2101.03, "timestamp": "00:35:01", "text": "后退。呃，是什么时候？而我看到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2104.27, "timestamp": "00:35:04", "text": "经常看到你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2107.99, "timestamp": "00:35:07", "text": "呃呃，阿斯特拉。阿斯特拉。是的。凭借阿斯特拉的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2111.48, "timestamp": "00:35:11", "text": "是活动上的东西，对吧？这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2112.87, "timestamp": "00:35:12", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2115.829, "timestamp": "00:35:15", "text": "是的。是的。就像这位虚拟主播很有才华一样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2119.43, "timestamp": "00:35:19", "text": "我猜也是。是的。才艺表演。是的。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2121.43, "timestamp": "00:35:21", "text": "等等，不是V，是Weep's Got"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2124.15, "timestamp": "00:35:24", "text": "天赋。不，我们有达人秀。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2126.47, "timestamp": "00:35:26", "text": "是的。是的。我想在那之前我就看到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2130.55, "timestamp": "00:35:30", "text": "我在Instagram上更多地看到了你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2133.75, "timestamp": "00:35:33", "text": "是的。是的。实际上，我当时更活跃。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2135.99, "timestamp": "00:35:35", "text": "我在Instagram上发帖是因为我当时这么想。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2138.47, "timestamp": "00:35:38", "text": "更像是一个不断发展的平台"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2140.03, "timestamp": "00:35:40", "text": "YouTube。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2144.71, "timestamp": "00:35:44", "text": "我当时在Twitch上直播。我直播了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2146.63, "timestamp": "00:35:46", "text": "而对于 Twitch 来说，大概两到三个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2149.589, "timestamp": "00:35:49", "text": "直播，然后我想，也许是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2152.87, "timestamp": "00:35:52", "text": "对我没用。所以我开始这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2155.67, "timestamp": "00:35:55", "text": "在 YouTube 上开始活跃，然后变得更加活跃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2158.55, "timestamp": "00:35:58", "text": "在 Instagram 上，就像离开 YouTube 一样。"}]